  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jerusalem Arab Film Festival Grant - re-coding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Irish Representative Office in Ramallah, through the Cultural Fund, will support the third edition of the Jerusalem Arab Film Festival, aiming to support the preservation of Palestinian culture in Jerusalem.&#xa0;The objective of this project is to improve Jerusalemite youth &#xa0;access to specialised cinema education, industries, activities and empowering them to develop professional careers in these fields through establishing the first cinema hub in Jerusalem. The project targets vulnerable youth from the most marginalised areas such as the Old City of Jerusalem.</narrative>
  </description>
